{
  "id": 135811838,
  "iid": 5950,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTCP: Don't always Decode As SRTCP",
  "description": "If RTCP is chosen via Decode As, decode as RTCP.\nIf SRTCP is chosen via Decode As, decode as SRTCP (assuming that\nall packets are encrypted, because we can't tell where the E bit is\nin that case.)\n\nIf possible [S]RTCP is found via the heuristic dissector, assume that\nit's RTCP as opposed to encrypted SRTCP. Perhaps the heuristic dissector\ncould be improved to guess between them, or perhaps there could be a\npreference added to prefer one or the other.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2022-01-19T04:57:52.010Z",
